cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TitanCNA Curation Agent"
abstract: >-
  A command-line agent that curates TitanCNA copy-number/LOH candidate
  solutions for tumor sequencing samples using deterministic statistics for
  triage plus two independent vision-capable LLM reviewers (Claude and
  Gemini) for visual QC, with a Perplexity-API-only or bring-your-own-key
  (Anthropic + Google) backend.
authors:
